<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Clearnet said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Clearnet said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities cut Clearnet Communications Inc to hold from buy, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Clearnet shares fell 1/2 to 12-3/8 on the Nasdaq in early trading.</p>
</text>
